#: plugin.toml
msgctxt "plugin.toml"
msgid "Annotations"
msgstr "Annotaties"

#: plugin.toml
msgctxt "plugin.toml"
msgid ""
"Point, region, line and text annotations with reusable classes, cell "
"counting, HPF fields and measurements; GeoJSON (QuPath) import and export, "
"ASAP and Aperio ImageScope XML import."
msgstr ""
"Punt-, gebieds-, lijn- en tekstannotaties met herbruikbare klassen, "
"celtelling, HPF-velden en metingen; import en export van GeoJSON (QuPath), "
"import van ASAP- en Aperio ImageScope-XML."

#: src/actions.rs:23
msgid "The annotations of this slide are still loading; try again in a moment."
msgstr ""
"De annotaties van dit preparaat worden nog geladen; probeer het zo opnieuw."

#: src/actions.rs:27 src/sidebar.rs:1390 src/sidebar.rs:1474
msgid "That layer no longer exists."
msgstr "Die laag bestaat niet meer."

#: src/actions.rs:31
